<app-navigation title="报名信息" show-back="{{true}}" bindback="navigationBack" />
<view class="registration-page">
<view class="title">填写报名信息</view>
<view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="registration-error">{{errorMessage}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{event}}">
<view class="registration-event"><view class="cover"><text>HONEY GOLD
CLUB</text><view>海岛<view>漫游记</view></view></view><view class="event-info"><view class="subtitle">{{event.subtitle}}</view><view class="event-title">{{event.title}}</view><view class="event-desc">{{event.description}}</view><view class="meta">◷ {{selectedDate}} {{selectedTime}}</view><view class="meta">⌖ {{event.location}}</view><text class="badge">{{isFull?'候补报名':'预约中'}} ›</text></view></view>
<view class="registration-selection">{{selectedType}}</view>
<view class="field">手机号 *<input wx:if="{{demo}}" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入测试手机号" value="{{phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="input"/><view wx:else><input disabled value="{{phone}}" placeholder="请授权微信手机号"/><button class="plain-button" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="getPhone">手机号快捷授权</button></view></view><view class="field">真实姓名 *<input placeholder="请输入姓名" maxlength="40" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field">性别 *<picker range="{{genders}}" bindchange="genderChange"><view class="picker gender-picker"><text>{{gender}}</text><view class="gender-chevron" /></view></picker></view><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="terms" checked="{{terms}}" color="#315c3f"/><view>我已阅读并同意<text class="link" catchtap="showTerms">使用条款、预约须知和隐私说明</text></view></label><label class="consent"><checkbox value="photo" checked="{{photo}}" color="#315c3f"/><view>我同意蜜金拍摄与我相关的活动照片视频，并在品牌平台发布（可选）。</view></label></checkbox-group><button class="gold-button booking-submit" disabled="{{busy||!terms}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交预约</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!errorMessage}}" class="empty">正在加载报名信息…</view>
<view wx:if="{{sheet==='terms'}}" class="mask" bindtap="closeSheet"><view class="sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="handle"/><view class="sheet-header"><text>预约条款与隐私说明</text><text class="close" bindtap="closeSheet">取消</text></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="sheet-scroll"><text class="description">此为演示条款，正式上线需品牌确认。

预约免费，每位嘉宾每场活动仅可预约一种体验。满额可候补，释放名额后按报名顺序递补。请提前 8 小时修改或取消，提前 15 分钟到场。

姓名、手机号与性别用于预约、会员记录和核销。拍摄授权单独选择，不影响预约资格。更正或删除个人信息、撤回授权请联系品牌工作人员。正式上线前需补充隐私联系方式、数据保存期限和最终条款。</text><button class="gold-button" bindtap="closeSheet">我已阅读，返回</button></scroll-view></view></view>
</view>